OL,3,GNEWSATfL developing proposals for
OL,4,Apublic-owned bus firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) says it is
OL,7,Fcurrently developing detailed proposals
OL,8,Ffor a publicly-owned bus company in
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,11,FThe plans were first outlined earlier
OL,12,Fthis year in TfL's business plan, which
OL,13,Fsaid the move formed part of efforts to
OL,14,F"reimagine London's bus network",
OL,16,FThere are currently 16 privately-owned
OL,17,Foperators running the capital's 675 bus
OL,18,Froutes, including Arriva, Go-Ahead
OL,19,FLondon, First Bus London and Stagecoach
OL,20,FLondon.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
